
Removing
────────
  delete  data/invoices/
  delete  feature/invoices/

  and the lines naming them in:
    settings.gradle.kts, app/build.gradle.kts, ui/AppDestinations.kt


  The modules are out of the build, but these folders could not all be deleted:
    data/invoices/
    feature/invoices/
  Something still holds files in them open, usually the Gradle daemon (./gradlew --stop)
  or the IDE. Delete them once it lets go.

